{
  "name": "muse_vtuber",
  "version": "4.1.0",
  "description": "DSH 界面交互（形象）：对话/轨迹之后的「形象」页签（LIVE2D 主位 + 频谱环，右侧栏视频/音频来自 mira_input）；表情/动作/显隐/模型 5 个工具与设置页「形象」。说话与输入分别由 mira_audio / mira_input 提供；4.1.0 起不再有账号/权限模型",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ]
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "live2d",
    "avatar",
    "vtuber"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Stella-Mira/muse_vtuber.git"
  }
}
